flowchart LR
  issue["Accepted GitHub issue"]
  repo["Owned GitHub source revision"]
  ci["Actions CI + quality gates"]
  artifact["Commit-bound tests / artifact"]
  environment["Protected environment + WIF"]
  azure["Azure app / SQL / telemetry"]
  issue -->|acceptance traceability| repo
  repo -->|reviewed CI-only workflow| ci
  ci -->|exact source provenance| artifact
  artifact -.->|separate release approval| environment
  environment -.->|optional protected live extension| azure
